  m_text: "Sort each email \u2014 SCAM or SAFE.\n\n\u25C0 Drag LEFT or tap <b>SCAM</b>
    \u2192 <color=#FF6B6B><b>Left Net</b></color>\nDrag RIGHT or tap <b>SAFE</b>
    \u2192 <color=#4ECDC4><b>Right Net</b></color>  \u25B6\n\n\u2713 Correct \u2192
